@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

actor "业主" as Owner
participant "PetProfileUI" as UI
participant "PetManager" as Ctrl
participant "PetLib" as Lib

Owner -> UI : 打开宠物档案
UI -> Ctrl : getPetList(ownerId)
Ctrl -> Lib : queryByOwner(ownerId)
Lib --> Ctrl : 返回宠物列表
Ctrl --> UI : 宠物列表+电子证状态

Owner -> UI : 点击某只宠物
UI -> Ctrl : getPetDetail(petId)
Ctrl -> Lib : queryById(petId)
Lib --> Ctrl : 宠物详情+电子证有效期
Ctrl --> UI : 完整信息
UI --> Owner : 显示宠物档案与电子证
@enduml